     =========================================================
     Geant4 - an Object-Oriented Toolkit for Simulation in HEP
     =========================================================

                            Test77
                            ------

  This test is validating the different types of scoring containers to guard
  against unexpected issues that arise from template resolution

  Author: Jonathan Madsen

  - This test emulates standard event-scoring into standard G4THitsMap<G4double>
    where G4Run::RecordEvent() takes the G4THitsMap<G4double> and adds it
    to the container in the derived G4Run
  - It also emulates G4Run::Merge() where the container used above is merge into
    a copy of itself (i.e. when a worker merges it's copy into master)
  - Variants tested:
      - all variants with G4double* (traditional pointer storage)
          - G4VTHitsMap     <G4double, std::map               <G4int, G4double*>>
          - G4VTHitsMap     <G4double, std::multimap          <G4int, G4double*>>
          - G4VTHitsMap     <G4double, std::unordered_map     <G4int, G4double*>>
          - G4VTHitsMap     <G4double, std::unordered_multimap<G4int, G4double*>>
          - G4VTHitsVector  <G4double, std::vector            <G4double*>>
          - G4VTHitsVector  <G4double, std::deque             <G4double*>>
      - all variants with G4double (non-pointer storage)
          - G4VTHitsVector  <G4double, std::vector            <G4double>>
          - G4VTHitsVector  <G4double, std::deque             <G4double>>
      - all variants with G4StatAnalysis* (traditional pointer storage)
          - G4VTHitsMap     <G4StatAnalysis, std::map               <G4int, G4StatAnalysis*>>
          - G4VTHitsMap     <G4StatAnalysis, std::multimap          <G4int, G4StatAnalysis*>>
          - G4VTHitsMap     <G4StatAnalysis, std::unordered_map     <G4int, G4StatAnalysis*>>
          - G4VTHitsMap     <G4StatAnalysis, std::unordered_multimap<G4int, G4StatAnalysis*>>
          - G4VTHitsVector  <G4StatAnalysis, std::vector            <G4StatAnalysis*>>
          - G4VTHitsVector  <G4StatAnalysis, std::deque             <G4StatAnalysis*>>
      - all variants with G4StatAnalysis (non-pointer storage)
          - G4VTHitsVector  <G4StatAnalysis, std::vector            <G4StatAnalysis>>
          - G4VTHitsVector  <G4StatAnalysis, std::deque             <G4StatAnalysis>>
